@title Import centre: tiles by purpose, search, detail pane, Import button
@area Layout
# Lane V4c (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). File > Import... opens one
# window with everything the program can bring in as a tile; picking one shows
# what it does. Search narrows the tiles; the Import button stays grey until a
# tile is picked. File no longer has the Import and Import parts submenus.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text File #1
wait 6
shot file-menu-one-import-row
click_text "Import..."
wait 10
shot centre-open
expect "Drawings and backgrounds"
expect "Projects"
expect "Choose an item on the left"
check_layout
click_text "Import parts table"
wait 6
shot centre-picked
expect "Parts from a CSV or Excel table"
check_layout
text eplan
wait 8
shot centre-search-eplan
expect "Import EPLAN project"
expect_not "Import parts table"
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
expect_not "Choose an item on the left"
